{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1322408001:2":{"text":"Snap out of it. There's no such thing as a Great Will.","source_cn":"清醒一点，这根本没什么伟大意志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDA61B3575334658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322408002:1":{"text":"I am ready to receive your guidance... Please answer the prayers of your devoted follower...","source_cn":"我愿意聆听您的指引……回应您的虔诚信徒吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1762118E0FD8BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322408003:1":{"text":"Show me the way. No matter what trials lie ahead, I will follow you without hesitation!","source_cn":"请指引我方向，只要是您在的地方我就算赴汤蹈火也在所不辞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0862320D053096FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322408004:1":{"text":"Looks like they're too far gone to listen to reason. We need to trick them into leaving.","source_cn":"看样子这些邪教徒暂时听不进去话了，得想个办法把他哄走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF7DB71E3F6631C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322408005:1":{"text":"Trick them? How? Their heads are filled with nothing but this \"Great Will\" garbage!","source_cn":"哄？要怎么哄？他们脑子里只有那个什么“伟大意志”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F7BD634449CC1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1322408005":{"text":"Trick them? How? Their heads are filled with nothing but this \"Great Will\" garbage!","source_cn":"哄？要怎么哄？他们脑子里只有那个什么“伟大意志”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F7BD634449CC1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322408006:1":{"text":"Hmm... I've got it!","source_cn":"嗯……有了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1259C51BB4DB018D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322408007:1":{"text":"Devoted followers! Heed the voice of the divine! The Great Will beckons you forward. Follow us!","source_cn":"虔诚的信徒们，聆听神的引导！伟大意志就在前方，跟随我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB45726D95D0B5182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322408008:1":{"text":"The Great Will... I think I can hear it! I'm coming! I will follow you to the end of the world!","source_cn":"伟大意志，我……似乎听到您的声音了！我来了，我永远跟随您！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE975B06B04C334FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322408009:1":{"text":"You're disturbingly good at this, Hammie.","source_cn":"真有你的，漫漫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D1940EF65CC3825","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Then let's play along.","source_cn":"那就假扮成伟大意志的引导者","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C484C03CE7BBD0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then let's play along.","female":"Then let's play along.","variant_male_record_index":"70038","variant_female_record_index":"70039","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"Gotta be smart about this.","source_cn":"要智取，要动脑筋","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA90DB5DC3D73084","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Gotta be smart about this.","female":"Gotta be smart about this.","variant_male_record_index":"70040","variant_female_record_index":"70041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:镇民安德烈":{"text":"Citizen Andre","source":"镇民安德烈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}